<section class="course-slider">
  <div class="swiper-container">

    <div class="swiper">    
      <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div style="background-image:url('https://rlc.edu/hubfs/divisions/allied%20health/Nursing/nursing-swiper-image-1280x751@150dpi@1.5x.jpg')" class="swiper__image">
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__content">
              <h5> Launch your career today</h5>
              <h2>Nursing</h2>
              <p>Unlock your nursing career potential with our Associate Degree Nursing (ADN) Program, expertly designed to prepare you for high-demand roles in the Southern Illinois community and across the nation.</p>
              
                  
                  
                  <a href="https://rlc.edu/nursing?hsLang=en" aria-label="Learn More - Nursing">
                    Learn More
                  </a>
              
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__arrows">
              <button class="swiper-button-prev swiper__prev"></button>
              <button class="swiper-button-next swiper__next"></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div style="background-image:url('https://rlc.edu/hubfs/website-2024-assets/slider-images/business-class-slider-image-1280x698.jpg')" class="swiper__image">
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__content">
              <h5> launch your career today</h5>
              <h2>Business</h2>
              <p>Immerse yourself in our Business program that provides a diverse curriculum and practical skills with guidance from highly experienced faculty. Get prepared for immediate entry into the workforce or transferring to a university.</p>
              
                  
                  
                  <a href="https://rlc.edu/business?hsLang=en" aria-label="Learn More - Business">
                    Learn More
                  </a>
              
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__arrows">
              <button class="swiper-button-prev swiper__prev"></button>
              <button class="swiper-button-next swiper__next"></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div style="background-image:url('https://rlc.edu/hubfs/website-2024-assets/slider-images/information-technology-class-slider-image.jpg')" class="swiper__image">
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__content">
              <h5> Launch your career today</h5>
              <h2>Information Technology</h2>
              <p>Our Information Technology programs are where hands-on experience meets modern curriculum. Diverse disciplines from computer science and cybersecurity to IT systems and networking help you gain immediate entry into the tech industry and a great start for further education. Train for the dynamic world of IT.</p>
              
                  
                  
                  <a href="https://rlc.edu/computer-science?hsLang=en" aria-label="Learn More - Information Technology">
                    Learn More
                  </a>
              
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__arrows">
              <button class="swiper-button-prev swiper__prev"></button>
              <button class="swiper-button-next swiper__next"></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div style="background-image:url('https://rlc.edu/hubfs/website-2024-assets/slider-images/student-studying-slider-image-1280x698.jpg')" class="swiper__image">
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__content">
              <h5> Launch Your Career Today</h5>
              <h2>Criminal Justice</h2>
              <p>Prepare for a rewarding career in law enforcement, courts, corrections, forensic science, private security and more. We offer degrees in Criminal Justice and short-term certificates in Private Protection and Police and Corrections, equipping you with the skills needed to make a significant impact on society.</p>
              
                  
                  
                  <a href="https://rlc.edu/criminal-justice?hsLang=en" aria-label="Learn More - Criminal Justice">
                    Learn More
                  </a>
              
            </div>
            <div class="swiper__arrows">
