<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17163889854397" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">

<section class="alternating-content"> 
    <div class="alternating-content__wrap "> 
        <div class="alternating-content__color-block"></div>
        <div class="alternating-content__inner">
            <div class="alternating-content__content"> 
                <h6>Student Portal</h6>
                <h3>Experience offers a wealth of resources to enhance your academic experience.</h3>
                <div class="alternating-content__text"> 
                    Through the portal, you can access our student learning system Canvas, and download the RLC Experience App. Utilize the Electronic Library and other Learning Resources for your research needs and manage your printing with PaperCut Print Management. The portal also provides access to Self-Service for course registration and academic records, WarriorMail for your student email, and a Password Reset Tool for account security. Stay informed with the Wireless Emergency Notification System and easily access various forms needed throughout your studies.
                </div>
                
                    <div class="alternating-content__cta"> 
                        
  
    <a class="cta-1 " href="https://rlc.edu/experience?hsLang=en">
      Go to Experience
    </a>
  

                    </div>
                
            </div>
