<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17163889596897" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">

<section class="alternating-content"> 
    <div class="alternating-content__wrap alternating-content__wrap--reverse-direction "> 
        <div class="alternating-content__color-block"></div>
        <div class="alternating-content__inner">
            <div class="alternating-content__content"> 
                <h6>Microscholarships</h6>
                <h3>Raise A Warrior</h3>
                <div class="alternating-content__text"> 
                    <p><span>Raise A Warrior, Rend Lake College's new microscholarship program, gives in-district students (grades 3 through 12) the opportunity to earn up to $2,000 for future enrollment at RLC.&nbsp;</span><span></span></p>
<p><span>Getting started is easy. Parents create an account, set up your child’s profile, and then enter and track points for activities like making the honor roll, playing sports, community service, clubs and groups, and much, much more. Earn points for all kinds of accomplishments.&nbsp;</span></p>
                </div>
                
                    <div class="alternating-content__cta"> 
                        
  
    <a class="cta-1 " href="https://rlc.edu/raise-a-warrior-microscholarships?hsLang=en">
      Learn More
    </a>
  

                    </div>
                
            </div>
            <div class="alternating-content__image"> 
                
                    
  <section class="video">
      
        

        
        <video id="videomodule_17163889596897" class="video-js vjs-default-skin" controls autoplay muted playsinline width="562" height="412" data-setup="{ &quot;sources&quot;: [{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;video/mp4&quot;, &quot;src&quot;: &quot;https://19965840.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/19965840/microscholarships-Raise%20A%20Warrior/rendlakecollege-raiseawarrior-promo-whiteboard-30sec-24fps-captions.mp4&quot;}] }"></video>
      
  </section>

                
            </div>
        </div>  
    </div>
</section></div>

